</arguments>
<doc>&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;DEPRECATED!!&lt;/b&gt; Use &lt;a href="#Expect%20Element" class="name"&gt;Expect Element&lt;/a&gt; instead Verifies that the element identified by &lt;code&gt;locator&lt;/code&gt; is visible.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Key attributes for arbitrary elements are &lt;span class="name"&gt;id&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;span class="name"&gt;name&lt;/span&gt;. See &lt;a href="#Introduction" class="name"&gt;introduction&lt;/a&gt; for details about locating elements.&lt;/p&gt;</doc>
<shortdoc>*DEPRECATED!!* Use `Expect Element` instead Verifies that the element identified by ``locator`` is visible.</shortdoc>
