&lt;p&gt;The difference between this keyword and &lt;a href="#Input%20Text" class="name"&gt;Input Text&lt;/a&gt; is that this keyword does not log the given password.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href="#Introduction" class="name"&gt;introduction&lt;/a&gt; for details about locating elements.&lt;/p&gt;</doc>
<shortdoc>Types the given password into the text field identified by ``locator``.</shortdoc>
</kw>
