<kw name="Log Source" source="E:\Project\RobotFrameworkStandard\.venv\Lib\site-packages\AppiumLibrary\keywords\_applicationmanagement.py" lineno="147">
<arguments repr="loglevel=INFO">
<arg kind="POSITIONAL_OR_NAMED" required="false" repr="loglevel=INFO">
<name>loglevel</name>
<default>INFO</default>
</arg>
</arguments>
<doc>&lt;p&gt;Logs and returns the entire html source of the current page or frame.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;code&gt;loglevel&lt;/code&gt; argument defines the used log level. Valid log levels are &lt;span class="name"&gt;WARN&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class="name"&gt;INFO&lt;/span&gt; (default), &lt;span class="name"&gt;DEBUG&lt;/span&gt;, &lt;span class="name"&gt;TRACE&lt;/span&gt; and &lt;a href="#type-None" class="name"&gt;NONE&lt;/a&gt; (no logging).&lt;/p&gt;</doc>
<shortdoc>Logs and returns the entire html source of the current page or frame.</shortdoc>
</kw>
